  "$comment": "A doctoral student walks a manuscript from first draft to a defended thesis, with Reviewer 2 waiting in the middle of the path. Extends dungeon-bright for palette, typography and decor; overrides naming, motifs and the back emblem. German names live under localeOverrides.de because the parent sets German names there too. Ten of the sixteen motifs are reused from the working-day deck — the family resemblance is accepted, not avoided. Two German gender notes: the Path is \"die Promotion\", feminine, so its accusative slots need no separate form, unlike mittagspause's masculine \"Arbeitstag\"; and Hilfe/Huerde are feminine with idiomatic plurals, so the objective prints \"8 Hilfen und 6 Huerden\" where \"8 Unterstuetzungen\" would not read. The Deity must stay feminine: de.json line 45 has \"ans Ende zur {card:D}\".",
